+# Performance history
+
+## SessionStart health gate
+
+Measured on a 5,000-record store:
+
+| Revision | SessionStart p50 |
+| --- | ---: |
+| Before `quick_check` was removed from the read path | 11.9 ms |
+| After `quick_check` was removed from the read path, with the `fts_rows` counter and body `CHECK` added in the same change | 1.05 ms |
+
+Because all three changes landed together, this measurement does not isolate their
+individual contributions.
